/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose. Every crate here that CI builds
# produces a binary, and the AWS SDK pins only its direct versions --
# without a committed lock, a fresh resolve picks two incompatible
# aws-smithy-schema versions and `cargo clippy --workspace` fails.
*.so
.pgrx/
/data/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
docker/.env
dist/
*.asc
*.pem
*.key
docker/wireguard/wg0.conf
docker/wireguard/clients/
